        <specification name="Civil planning alternatives carry explicit native unit rates" ifcVersion="IFC4X3_ADD2" identifier="OSR-IDS-COST-ITEM-001" description="Each at-grade, elevated, or bridge alternative is a named cost item with one generated cost value and no implied selected scope.">
